<title>USA: TWA starts non-stop St. Louis-Paris flight.</title>
<headline>TWA starts non-stop St. Louis-Paris flight.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc on Wednesday said it will launch non-stop service between St. Louis and Paris beginning Thursday.</p>
<p>The flight will leave St. Louis at 1900 CDT on Thursday May 1 (0000 GMT Friday).</p>
<p>TWA said it would award free trips to Paris to two people and their companions to kick off the new flight.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
